<title>USA: U.S. offering to sell 1 million lbs of cobalt.  [CORRECTED 16:25 GMT 3/12]</title>
<headline>U.S. offering to sell 1 million lbs of cobalt.  [CORRECTED 16:25 GMT 3/12]</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects from 750,000 lbs to 1 million lbs).</p>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile said Monday it is offering to sell 1 million pounds of cobalt.</p>
<p>The agency will start receiving bids for the cobalt at 1300 EST/1800 GMT Monday, an official said.</p>
<p>Awards will be made on Thursday.</p>
</text>
